OL,3,GNEWSAFlash flood forces road closure
OL,4,Aafter heavy rain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road has been closed after heavy
OL,7,Frainfall caused flash flooding in an
OL,8,Farea of Wolverhampton.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Fire Service were called
OL,11,Fto Spring Road, Ettingshall, just
OL,12,Fbefore 07:30 BST on Saturday to assist
OL,13,Fwith tackling the problem.
OL,15,FCity of Wolverhampton Council said the
OL,16,Froad would stay closed until safety
OL,17,Fchecks were completed and it was safe
OL,18,Fto reopen.
OL,20,FDrivers have been urged to avoid the
OL,21,Farea and follow diversion signs.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
